WEBVTT

00:01:58.573 --> 00:02:00.974
and a fastball's coming in,

00:02:00.974 --> 00:02:03.290
and it hits him on the wrist.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.540
Oh, Pete.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.274
His wrist went completely limp, like this.

00:02:08.274 --> 00:02:09.790
So for the next six months,

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:12.470
Pete went back to his home in Southie,

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:15.417
kept working that unpassionate job,

00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:16.813
and was going to doctors

00:02:16.813 --> 00:02:18.686
to see what was wrong with this wrist

00:02:18.686 --> 00:02:20.556
that never came back.

00:02:20.556 --> 00:02:22.522
Six months later, in March,

00:02:22.522 --> 00:02:24.485
he called my husband 
and me, and he said,

00:02:24.485 --> 00:02:26.487
"Oh, Mom and Dad, we have a doctor

00:02:26.487 --> 00:02:29.491
that found a diagnosis for that wrist.

00:02:29.491 --> 00:02:32.647
Do you want to come with the
doctor's appointment with me?"